# Ultra on a model that offers it, its status, /fast turning it off, and a
# model change turning both off (account-model research §5-§6). The wait
# between Escape and Enter keeps the two keys apart: sent together they are
# Alt-Enter, a line break, which is what the research capture recorded.
models models.json
seed fast-seed-astra.json
nomodel
wait 2.5
snap start
type /ultrafast on
key Enter
wait 1
snap uf-on
home uf-on
type /ultrafast
key Enter
wait 1
snap uf-status
type /fast
key Enter
wait 1
snap fast-after-uf
home fast-after-uf
type /ultrafast on
key Enter
wait 1
type /model xai/grok-4.7
wait 0.5
key Escape
wait 0.4
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap model-change-clears
home end
